<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I was watching a snarky YouTube video where a watch influencer was ranking all watch brands. He labeled <a href="https://www.christopherward.com/">Christopher Ward</a> his favorite emerging indie brand. So here we go.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">It&#8217;s got <a href="https://www.tudorwatch.com/">Tudor</a>-esque chonk on both the markers and the hands. The ceramic bezel is a work of art &#8212; one of those you have to feel with your hands. The face, the asphalt vibes of a <a href="https://www.patek.com/en/collection/calatrava/5226g-001">Patek</a>, is compelling. I am a known sucker for a splash of orange, and there are multiple splashes to love. V-strap? Possible mistake. Jury is out.</p>


